  itemName: Unfinished Letter
  itemType: 1
  icon: {fileID: -811217553, guid: 44bb429c66c7df816b55d41878254ce0, type: 3}
  description: An unfinished letter
  fileText: 'Roxanne - I have been trying to find the right moment for weeks and
    I keep putting it off because I don''t know how you''ll take it. There''s something
    you need to know about the contract you signed when you first came to work here.
    I found something in the founding documents that I can''t explain except by concluding
    that the woman who drew up the papers was not - [letter ends mid-sentence]'
